      "created_at": "2026-01-20T06:16:36.015Z",
      "cooked": "<p>There is a field on mostly all DocTypes in ERPNext using which you can override the exchange rate.</p>\n<p><div class=\"lightbox-wrapper\"><a class=\"lightbox\" href=\"https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/original/3X/7/d/7d9fc788b1c64b74b5d798863ca06269b4de968d.png\" data-download-href=\"https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/7d9fc788b1c64b74b5d798863ca06269b4de968d\" title=\"CleanShot 2026-01-20 at 11.45.14@2x\"><img src=\"https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/optimized/3X/7/d/7d9fc788b1c64b74b5d798863ca06269b4de968d_2_690x396.png\" alt=\"CleanShot 2026-01-20 at 11.45.14@2x\" data-base62-sha1=\"hVk0B75vCU2JbFADPRXEFdURunb\" width=\"690\" height=\"396\" srcset=\"https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/optimized/3X/7/d/7d9fc788b1c64b74b5d798863ca06269b4de968d_2_690x396.png, https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/optimized/3X/7/d/7d9fc788b1c64b74b5d798863ca06269b4de968d_2_1035x594.png 1.5x, https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/optimized/3X/7/d/7d9fc788b1c64b74b5d798863ca06269b4de968d_2_1380x792.png 2x\" data-dominant-color=\"1B1B1C\"><div class=\"meta\"><svg class=\"fa d-icon d-icon-far-image svg-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use href=\"#far-image\"></use></svg><span class=\"filename\">CleanShot 2026-01-20 at 11.45.14@2x</span><span class=\"informations\">2252×1294 200 KB</span><svg class=\"fa d-icon d-icon-discourse-expand svg-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use href=\"#discourse-expand\"></use></svg></div></a></div></p>\n<p>For example, I had changed the currency to USD and it autofetched 90.8. Then I just changed it and saved the document and it worked.</p>",
